  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The mass of ice,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math>,&nbsp;</p><p>Energy required to melt the ice,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>L</mi></math>,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>i</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn></msup><mi>R</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>L</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2000</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>330</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>53</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi math